<title>JAPAN: Meiji Life 96/97 parent results.</title>
<headline>Meiji Life 96/97 parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	  (in billions yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Premium income		 2.52 trln   vs	    2.69 trln</p>
<p> Asset Invest Gains	 700.60	  vs	  756.40</p>
<p> Insurance Payments	   2.60 trln   vs	    1.79 trln</p>
<p> Asset invest costs	 338.10	  vs	  205.50</p>
<p> Current			207.50	  vs	  194.80</p>
<p> Total assets		  16.71 trln   vs	   16.63 trln</p>
<p> Investment yield	    2.29%	  vs	   3.28%</p>
<p>NOTE - Meiji Life Insurance Co is a major life insurance company.</p>
